{"about_the_game":"<strong>Sudoku Zenkai</strong> is a game for beginners and advanced Sudoku players.<br><br><strong>It lets you play cooperatively with your friends!</strong> You can start a new puzzle with a friend or simply ask one to help you on that tricky one, two heads are always better than one (usually).<br><br>Train your brain, logic and perception skills with Sudoku Zenkai puzzles in six different difficulties so that you can start on trainee levels to exercise your logical thinking and memory, or just jump to the insane levels to give your mind a real workout.<br><br>Sudoku Zenkai also features different themes allowing to play on which style you find most comfortable. Tired of numbers? With Sudoku Zenkai emblems you can spice up any Sudoku puzzle with letters, greek, kanji and more.<br><br>This game has its own high-quality puzzle generator (no internet required), everyday you can enjoy fresh puzzles and compete with friends on who has the best time.<br>With Sudoku Zenkai, you won\u2019t be looking for a paper puzzle ever again!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Six difficulty levels </strong>, from Trainee to Zenkai, ensuring that you will be able to find a puzzle that matches your skill level.<br></li><li><strong>Co-op Mode</strong>, invite a friend to help you out solving the puzzle!<br></li><li><strong>High-quality puzzle generator</strong>, no matter how much you play there will be always fresh and unique puzzles available.<br></li><li>A <strong>Theme</strong> for all, pick the theme that best suits your style.<br></li><li><strong>Emblems</strong>, tired of numbers? Try some of our emblems that range from letters, greek to kanji!<br></li><li>Turn on <strong>Pencil</strong> mode to make notes as if you were on paper. Each time you fill in a cell, notes are automatically updated!<br></li><li><strong>Duplicate Highlighting</strong> to avoid repeating numbers in a row, column and square .<br></li><li><strong>Hints</strong>, that help you get past that hurdle.<br></li><li><strong>Last Valid Board</strong>, made a mistake and don't know where? With last valid board you can get back into the past where everything was good!<br></li><li><strong>Achievements and Leaderboards</strong>, because unlocking and comparing times is fun!<br></li><li><strong>Steam Cloud support.</strong></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2c71ea65452966e030b7dc86dd3ffc3789746f84.jpg","localized_name":"Daily Teaser","name":"Daily Teaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/2c71ea65452966e030b7dc86dd3ffc3789746f84.jpg"},{"icon":"719fd812e9f7ba590988dac73077937d9d80852e.jpg","localized_name":"Hint User","name":"Hint User","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/719fd812e9f7ba590988dac73077937d9d80852e.jpg"},{"icon":"f506f57be5af781050fe98d8610f449d0229811b.jpg","localized_name":"We have to go back!","name":"We have to go back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/f506f57be5af781050fe98d8610f449d0229811b.jpg"},{"icon":"faca951759de5de47281252150d39908c1ef13a5.jpg","localized_name":"Who needs numbers?!","name":"Who needs numbers?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/faca951759de5de47281252150d39908c1ef13a5.jpg"},{"icon":"2c2ce522d7fe20b2eccff094cd2777834c966231.jpg","localized_name":"Mental Annotation","name":"Mental Annotation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/2c2ce522d7fe20b2eccff094cd2777834c966231.jpg"},{"icon":"54ce1cc56d3a5e420c0282dda644111c5b25935c.jpg","localized_name":"Daily Cooperation","name":"Daily Cooperation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/809850/54ce1cc56d3a5e420c0282dda644111c5b25935c.jpg"},{"icon":"f0c7031cd017004c7548dafcc4f6211aab2029a4.jpg","localized_name":"Patient","name":"Patient","path":"https